arguments.prompt:
Implement a shipment tracking Blazor Web App in the existing scaffolded project at `/tmp/sv-a4775e7f034d4b89aae512cbb5f45bfb/ShipmentTracker`. The project was created with `dotnet new blazor -o ShipmentTracker -int Auto -ai -au Individual`.

## Project Structure
- Server project: `/tmp/sv-a4775e7f034d4b89aae512cbb5f45bfb/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/`
- Client project: `/tmp/sv-a4775e7f034d4b89aae512cbb5f45bfb/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/`

## Architecture Rules (Auto Global mode)
- All interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Components cannot access DbContext directly — must use HTTP APIs
- Define service interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient there
- Server implements same interfaces with direct DB access
- Both Program.cs files register matching services
- API endpoints on server for data access

## What to Implement

### 1. Shared Models (in Client project under `Models/`)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; }
    public DateTime? EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Exception
}
```

### 2. Service Interface (Client project `Services/`)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string email);
    Task<Shipment> CreateShipmentAsync(Shipment shipment);
    Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status);
}
```

### 3. Client Implementation

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentHttpService.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentHttpService(HttpClient httpClient) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await httpClient.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await httpClient.GetFromJsonAsync<Shipment?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string email)
    {
        return await httpClient.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>($"api/shipments/customer/{Uri.EscapeDataString(email)}") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment> CreateShipmentAsync(Shipment shipment)
    {
        var response = await httpClient.PostAsJsonAsync("api/shipments", shipment);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
        return await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<Shipment>() ?? shipment;
    }

    public async Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        var response = await httpClient.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", status);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
    }
}
```

### 4. Server-side EF Entity and DbContext Update

Create `ShipmentTracker/Data/ShipmentEntity.cs`:
```csharp
using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ShipmentEntity
{
    public int Id { get; set; }

    [MaxLength(50)]
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [MaxLength(200)]
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [MaxLength(200)]
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    public int Status { get; set; }

    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; }

    public DateTime? EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }

    [MaxLength(256)]
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [MaxLength(500)]
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
```

Update `ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity.EntityFrameworkCore;
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ApplicationDbContext(DbContextOptions<ApplicationDbContext> options) : IdentityDbContext<ApplicationUser>(options)
{
    public DbSet<ShipmentEntity> Shipments => Set<ShipmentEntity>();

    protected override void OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder builder)
    {
